      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/6/eng@/~chp_X",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The First Schedule to the Code is amended by inserting after the item relating to section 507 of the Penal Code the following items under the respective columns: 1 2 3 4 5 Penal Offence Whether Whether a Whether Code the police warrant or bailable or may a summons not ordinarily shall arrest ordinarily without issue in warrant or the first not instance “507a Stalking do. do. do."
      }
    },
